note Trigger: HIDE_ALL_CODE (doc-code), one toggle. Model::next_hide says what a press does: Show while every step's code is hidden, otherwise Hide; the label names it ('show all code' or 'hide all code') and the toggle is drawn on while the code is hidden. The palette keeps both 'hide all code' and 'show all code'.

